---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = '29 May 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | GlobalsBlog"
  description="Read the GlobalsBlog Privacy Policy to understand how we collect, use, and protect visitor data, including our use of Google Analytics and Google AdSense."
>
  <section class="content-page">
    <div class="content-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p>
      <h1>How GlobalsBlog handles your data</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        This Privacy Policy explains what information GlobalsBlog collects when you visit the site,
        how it is used, and what choices you have. Last updated: <strong>{lastUpdated}</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-grid">
      <div>

        <article class="content-card">
          <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
          <p>
            When you visit GlobalsBlog we may automatically collect non-personal technical data
            including your browser type, operating system, referring URL, pages visited, and
            approximate geographic region. If you submit a comment, we collect the name, optional
            email address, and comment text you provide.
          </p>
          <p>
            We do not collect any financial information or government-issued identification.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="content-card" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <h2>2. Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            GlobalsBlog uses cookies — small text files stored in your browser — for the following
            purposes:
          </p>
          <ul class="content-list">
            <li>
              <strong>Analytics cookies</strong> — Google Analytics places cookies to help us understand
              how visitors use the site (pages viewed, session length, traffic sources). This data is
              aggregated and anonymous.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Advertising cookies</strong> — Google AdSense places cookies to serve
              personalised advertisements based on your browsing history across websites. These cookies
              may track you across other sites.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Preference cookies</strong> — We store your cookie consent choice
              (Accept / Decline) in your browser's local storage so we do not repeatedly ask.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            You can control or delete cookies at any time through your browser settings.
            Disabling cookies will not prevent you from reading content on this site.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="content-card" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <h2>3. Google Analytics</h2>
          <p>
            We use Google Analytics to measure traffic and improve the site. Google Analytics
            collects data such as session duration, device type, and pages visited. This data is
            sent to and stored by Google. You can opt out by installing the
            <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on
            </a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            Google's privacy policy applies to data collected through Google Analytics:
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              policies.google.com/privacy
            </a>.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="content-card" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <h2>4. Google AdSense &amp; advertising</h2>
          <p>
            GlobalsBlog displays advertisements through <strong>Google AdSense</strong>. Google uses
            cookies and similar tracking technologies to show ads that may be relevant to your
            interests based on your browsing activity on this and other websites.
          </p>
          <p>
            Specifically, Google may use the <strong>DoubleClick cookie</strong> to serve ads on our
            site and on other sites across the internet. You can opt out of personalised advertising
            by visiting
            <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              Google Ads Settings
            </a>
            or
            <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              aboutads.info
            </a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior
            visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it
            and its partners to serve ads based on your visit to our site and other sites on the
            internet.
          </p>
          <ul class="content-list">
            <li>Advertisements on this site are clearly separate from editorial content.</li>
            <li>We do not control which specific ads appear; Google's systems determine ad relevance.</li>
            <li>We may earn revenue when visitors interact with displayed advertisements.</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="content-card" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <h2>5. How we use collected information</h2>
          <ul class="content-list">
            <li>To monitor and improve site performance and the reader experience</li>
            <li>To respond to comments, questions, or business enquiries</li>
            <li>To serve relevant advertisements through Google AdSense</li>
            <li>To understand traffic patterns and popular content categories</li>
            <li>To detect and prevent spam, abuse, or security issues</li>
          </ul>
          <p>We do not sell, rent, or share personally identifiable information with third parties
          except as described in this policy or as required by law.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="content-card" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <h2>6. Calculator tools — no data collected</h2>
          <p>
            GlobalsBlog hosts free online calculators (Fuel Cost, Car Loan EMI, EV Savings, Toll,
            Trip Cost, Travel Budget Planner, Road Trip Planner, and Train vs Flight Calculator).
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>All calculator inputs and results are processed entirely within your browser.</strong>
            No values you enter into any calculator are transmitted to our servers, stored in any
            database, or shared with third parties. The calculators function as client-side JavaScript
            only — the moment you close or refresh the page, all entered data is gone.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="content-card" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <h2>7. Third-party services</h2>
          <p>GlobalsBlog uses the following third-party services that may process data:</p>
          <ul class="content-list">
            <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — website traffic analysis</li>
            <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — advertising</li>
            <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — site hosting and edge delivery</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Each provider processes data under their own privacy policies. We encourage you to review
            those policies directly.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="content-card" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <h2>8. Children's privacy</h2>
          <p>
            GlobalsBlog does not knowingly collect data from children under the age of 13. If you
            believe a child has submitted personal information to this site, please contact us and
            we will remove it promptly.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="content-card" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy when our services, business, or legal requirements
            change. The "last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the most recent
            revision. Continued use of the site after updates constitutes acceptance of the
            revised policy.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="content-card content-card-accent" style="position:sticky;top:1.5rem">
          <h2>Your privacy choices</h2>
          <p>You have the following rights regarding your data:</p>
          <ul class="content-list">
            <li>Decline non-essential cookies using the banner shown on your first visit</li>
            <li>Opt out of Google personalised ads at
              <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                google.com/settings/ads
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>Opt out of interest-based advertising at
              <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                aboutads.info
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>Disable cookies entirely in your browser settings</li>
            <li>Request removal of a comment or submitted data by emailing us</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 style="margin-top:1.5rem">Contact</h2>
          <p>
            For privacy-related questions or data removal requests:
          </p>
          <p>
            GlobalsBlog<br />
            The Edge Tower, Ramprastha City,<br />
            Sector 37D, Gurugram, Haryana, India<br />
            <a href="mailto:contact@globalsblog.com">contact@globalsblog.com</a>
          </p>

          <h2 style="margin-top:1.5rem">Useful links</h2>
          <ul class="content-list">
            <li>
              <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                Google Privacy Policy
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                How Google uses cookies in advertising
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                Google Analytics opt-out
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://optout.networkadvertising.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                NAI opt-out tool
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
